OL,3,GNEWSASurvivors fear being hurt by
OL,4,Aabusers released early from prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains details
OL,7,Fabout domestic abuse that some readers
OL,8,Fmay find distressing.
OL,10,FA woman says she almost hopes her
OL,11,Fabusive ex-boyfriend, who is now
OL,12,Feligible for early prison release,
OL,13,Freoffends to prove the government's
OL,14,Fscheme to ease overcrowding in jails is
OL,15,F"wrong".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
