OL,3,GNEWSASurvivors fear being hurt by
OL,4,Aabusers released early from prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate, not her real name, was strangled
OL,7,Fand attacked by her ex, who will now
OL,8,Fonly serve a third of his sentence
OL,9,Finstead of half. She is among women the
OL,10,FBBC has spoken to who are worried for
OL,11,Ftheir safety because of the scheme. She
OL,12,Fsaid her abuser was still an "angry
OL,13,Fhuman that doesn't care, which means he
OL,14,Fwill come and hurt me".
OL,16,FAbout 700 offenders were released in
OL,17,FEngland and Wales on Thursday under the
OL,18,Fscheme.
